## Data Licensing (Future)

No empirical participant data exists in this repository. When empirical data
is collected in future stages, it will not be committed to this public
repository. Any future data sharing will follow separate ethical and legal
protocols, including:

- IRB approval for data sharing.
- De-identification and anonymization.
- Consent provisions for secondary use.
- A separate data use agreement, if applicable.

## No Warranty on Research Claims

Nothing in this license constitutes a warranty about the scientific
validity, generalizability, or completeness of the model or protocol.
STRATIM is a pre-registered protocol at v0.1.0. No empirical validation
has been conducted. Users of the code should not represent STRATIM as
empirically validated.

